  "body": "\n\nThanks for sending an issue! Please fill in the following template to help quickly solve your problem.\n\n### Describe the current behavior / 问题描述 (Mandatory / 必填)\n            \n在A3 16P环境下运行Moe_Distribute_Dispatch_V2算子，使能comm_alg为\"fullmesh_v2\"和动态量化场景下部分用例出现expandx精度问题\n### Environment / 环境信息 (Mandatory / 必填)\n            \nA3 16P aarch64环境\n### Steps to reproduce the issue / 重现步骤 (Mandatory / 必填)\n            \n1. 进入A3 16P环境；\n2. 装上完整的cann包；\n3. 设置Moe_Distribute_Dispatch_V2算子参数comm_alg为\"fullmesh_v2\"，quantmode=2，bs=36，h=1024，k=1，localmoe=9\n4. 运行算子\n### Describe the expected behavior / 预期结果 (Mandatory / 必填)\n            \nexpandx精度都通过\n### Related log / screenshot / 日志 / 截图 (Mandatory / 必填)\n            \n<a href=\"https://gitcode.com/user-attachments/files/7673863/8817ca8e4e0a4f178908dbaa2ca62e5a.png\" target=\"_blank\">8817ca8e4e0a4f178908dbaa2ca62e5a.png</a>\n### Special notes for this issue/备注 (Optional / 选填)\n            \n\n",
